1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,890
Slide 36 diagrams "DEFENSE IN DEPTH FOR AGENTS."

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:18,830
Look at the three concentric security rings: Ring 1 is Input Sanitization at the boundary; Ring 2 is Runtime Sandboxing during execution; and Ring 3 is Egress Filtering on network calls.

3
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:30,740
Even if a sophisticated attacker manages to bypass Ring 1, the sandboxed environment prevents system takeover, and egress filtering blocks unauthorized data leaks.

4
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:37,010
Layered defense ensures that your personal avatar remains an unbreachable digital fortress!

